 "remarks": "JUST REDUCED-AMAZING PRICE. Exceptional investment opportunity in the heart of New Canaan. This fully leased, income-producing 3-family property offers immediate cash flow and long-term value in one of Fairfield County's most desirable communities. Generating $9000+ per month in rental income, the property is meticulously maintained and features 3 well appointed residences, each with in-unit laundry, garage and functional layouts that attract quality tenants. A rare offering, the property incls 6 garage spaces-4 attached to the main residence plus a detached 2-car garage with loft storage-providing additional rental potential, storage, or future flexibility. The charming grounds feature a delightful garden setting, creating an appealing environment for residents. Ideally located within walking distance to New Canaan's vibrant downtown, residents enjoy easy access to fine dining, boutique shopping, parks, cultural attractions, and the Metro-North train with direct service to Grand Central Terminal. Consistently recognized for its top-rated schools, picturesque New England character, and exceptional quality of life, New Canaan remains one of Connecticut's most sought-after residential destinations. Whether expanding an investment portfolio or seeking a multi-generational living opportunity with strong income potential, this turnkey property presents a rare chance to own a premier multi-family asset in an exceptional location. This is a rare opportunity for a savvy purchaser",
